  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7302.06 Presidentially declared disaster",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7302.06 “Presidentially declared disaster” means that the severity of the damages incurred is beyond the combined capabilities of state and local governments to respond and the federal government will provide funds to assist with recovery efforts.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #13168, 2-19-21",
